@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #466482
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9AA8B8
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceParticipantPadding 18
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
hide footbox
autonumber
title UC-JOB-005 验收并归档部门任务 · 分析序列
actor "目标部门部长" as actor
boundary "业务页面" as page
control "部门协作控制" as ctl
entity "账号与会话" as identity
entity "部门任务簿" as model
entity "工时台账" as ledger
actor -> page : 验收并归档部门任务\n版本、结论、原因
activate page
page -> ctl : 协调业务请求(UC-JOB-005)
activate ctl
ctl -> identity : 验证访问资格(会话、业务职责)
activate identity
identity --> ctl : 可信身份与可用范围
deactivate identity
ctl -> model : 核验当前条件(输入、身份)
activate model
model -> model : 核验验收资格和交付版本()
model --> ctl : 可办理结果／失败原因
deactivate model
alt 业务条件满足
ctl -> model : 验收并归档部门任务()
activate model
group 完成、归档与贡献整体生效
model -> model : 形成正常验收与归档事实()
model -> ledger : 登记合格贡献(内部资格、规则版本、来源键)
activate ledger
ledger --> model : 唯一贡献结果
deactivate ledger
end
model --> ctl : 业务结果与后续操作
deactivate model
ctl --> page : 成功回执
page --> actor : 展示结果
else 业务条件不满足
ctl --> page : 失败原因与可恢复条件
page --> actor : 保留输入并显示原因
end
deactivate ctl
deactivate page
legend bottom left
前置条件：
存在待验收交付物；采编办公由办公或采编管理人员办理
成功事实：
验收、归档、合格贡献与通知意图
完成、归档、合格贡献一起生效；重复不再计时。
endlegend

@enduml
